    {"id": "re_properties_module", "label": "Real Estate Properties Module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "modules/real-estate-properties/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owns team-scoped property records, structured attributes, lifecycle status and immutable history. Kept presentation-neutral so API, Filament and Livewire adapters depend on it without duplicating its rules. Never assumes application App\\ classes; actor and team IDs are explicit at mutation boundaries; its migration owns only the two tables in the package, and disabling the module does not delete data."},
